    "single-sample-text": {
      "type": "quizforge.single-choice@3",
      "question": {
        "stem": "<p>下列哪一个数是<strong>偶数</strong>？</p>",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "choice-3",
            "content": "<p>3</p>"
          },
          {
            "id": "choice-6",
            "content": "<p>6</p>"
          },
          {
            "id": "choice-7",
            "content": "<p>7</p>"
          },
          {
            "id": "choice-9",
            "content": "<p>9</p>"
          }
        ]
      },
      "solution": {
        "selected": "choice-6",
        "explanation": "<p><strong>6 是偶数。</strong></p><p>偶数能被 2 整除。6 ÷ 2 = 3，其余三个数除以 2 都有余数。</p>"
      }
    },
    "single-sample-image-math": {
      "type": "quizforge.single-choice@3",
      "question": {
        "stem": "<p>如图，直角三角形的两条直角边分别为 $3\\,\\mathrm{cm}$ 和 $4\\,\\mathrm{cm}$，斜边的长度是多少？</p><img src=\"qf-asset:assets/96fbe7bbe9e76622b6236d0d0fbfddb92f022249ac38bdbbd908efd3bf3791a8.png\" alt=\"直角三角形，两条直角边分别长3厘米和4厘米，斜边长度未知\" width=\"360\">",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "length-4",
            "content": "<p>$4\\,\\mathrm{cm}$</p>"
          },
          {
            "id": "length-5",
            "content": "<p>$5\\,\\mathrm{cm}$</p>"
          },
          {
            "id": "length-6",
            "content": "<p>$6\\,\\mathrm{cm}$</p>"
          },
          {
            "id": "length-7",
            "content": "<p>$7\\,\\mathrm{cm}$</p>"
          }
        ]
      },
      "solution": {
        "selected": "length-5",
        "explanation": "<p>斜边长为 $5\\,\\mathrm{cm}$。</p><p>根据勾股定理：</p>$$c=\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=\\sqrt{25}=5$$"
      }
    },
    "single-sample-table-options": {
      "type": "quizforge.single-choice@3",
      "question": {
        "stem": "<p>已知 $y=x^2$。下列哪张表中的对应关系全部正确？</p>",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "table-1",
            "content": "<table><tr><th><p>x</p></th><th><p>-1</p></th><th><p>0</p></th><th><p>1</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>y</p></td><td><p>-1</p></td><td><p>0</p></td><td><p>1</p></td></tr></table>"
          },
          {
            "id": "table-2",
            "content": "<table><tr><th><p>x</p></th><th><p>-1</p></th><th><p>0</p></th><th><p>1</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>y</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>0</p></td><td><p>1</p></td></tr></table>"
          },
          {
            "id": "table-3",
            "content": "<table><tr><th><p>x</p></th><th><p>-1</p></th><th><p>0</p></th><th><p>1</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>y</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>1</p></td></tr></table>"
          },
          {
            "id": "table-4",
            "content": "<table><tr><th><p>x</p></th><th><p>-1</p></th><th><p>0</p></th><th><p>1</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>y</p></td><td><p>-1</p></td><td><p>0</p></td><td><p>-1</p></td></tr></table>"
          }
        ]
      },
      "solution": {
        "selected": "table-2",
        "explanation": "<p>第二张表正确。分别代入三个值：</p>$$(-1)^2=1,\\quad 0^2=0,\\quad 1^2=1$$<p>因此对应的 y 值依次为 1、0、1。</p>"
      }
    },
    "multiple-sample-numbers": {
      "type": "quizforge.multiple-choice@3",
      "question": {
        "stem": "<p>下列哪些数是<strong>偶数</strong>？请选择所有正确选项。</p>",
